    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "Layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThe design of equipped play areas \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eprovide opportunities for both side-by-side play and solo play \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Einclude comfortable, durable seating that allows good natural surveillance of all play elements \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Efeature appropriate and clear signage and wayfinding \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eprovide litter bins which are strategically placed, and are in sufficient numbers in relation to the proposals \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ewhere fencing is required to protect safety of users (such as roads or water courses) it \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Ebe provided as a 900mm high fence with at least 2 access and egress points (gates) and a minimum of one bin per entrance/exit to the play area\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
    <developmentScales>
      <Value><![CDATA[[
  "Major Residential Applications (10\u002B homes)",
  "Other Major Applications"
]]]></Value>
